      "title": "FreeRTOS 的任务状态有哪些？",
      "source_text": "FreeRTOS 的任务状态有哪些？",
      "explanation": "任务状态包括 Ready、Running、Blocked 和 Suspended；Ready 等待调度器，Running 正在执行，Blocked 等待事件或超时，Suspended 被 vTaskSuspend() 显式挂起。",
      "source_file": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sering-Hong/embedded-interview/main/freertos/basics.md",
