      "difficulty": "中",
      "company_tags": "iot-embedded",
      "title": "FreeRTOS 的堆管理方案有哪些？",
      "source_text": "FreeRTOS 的堆管理方案有哪些？",
      "explanation": "heap_1 只分配不释放；heap_2 支持释放但不合并碎片；heap_4 支持释放并合并相邻空闲块，适合通用场景；heap_5 支持非连续内存区域。",
      "source_file": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sering-Hong/embedded-interview/main/freertos/basics.md",
      "source_module": "freertos/basics"
