      "title": "如何调试 FreeRTOS 栈溢出？",
      "source_text": "如何调试 FreeRTOS 栈溢出？",
      "explanation": "可设置 configCHECK_FOR_STACK_OVERFLOW = 2 并实现 vApplicationStackOverflowHook()，使用 uxTaskGetStackHighWaterMark() 查询历史最低剩余栈空间，也可用填充模式或 Keil Stack Analyzer 检查。",
      "source_file": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sering-Hong/embedded-interview/main/freertos/basics.md",
